<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Bond and Bail Bond under CrPC, 1973</title>
 <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 40px;
      color: #333;
      font-size: large;
    }
    h2 {
      text-align: center;
      text-decoration: underline;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
    p {
      text-align: justify;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    ol {
      margin-left: 20px;
    }
    ul {
      margin-left: 20px;
    }
    strong {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <h2>Draft of Bond and Bail Bond under Criminal Procedure Code, 1973 after Arrest Under a Warrant</h2>

  <p>
    I (<%= personName %>), <%= personAddress %> being brought before the District Magistrate of <%= magistrateCourt %> (or as the case may be) under a warrant issued to compel my appearance to answer to the charge of <%= charge %> do hereby bind myself to attend in the court of <%= answerCourt %> on the <%= answerDay %> day of <%= answerMonth %>, <%= answerYear %> to answer to the said charge, and to continue to attend until otherwise directed by the court, and in case of my making default herein, I bind myself to forfeit to Government, the sum of Rs. <%= forfeitAmount %>.
  </p>

  <p>
    Dated this <%= bondDateDay %> day of <%= bondDateMonth %>, <%= bondDateYear %>
  </p>

  <p>
    (Signature): <%= personSignature %>
  </p>

  <hr style="margin: 32px 0;">

  <p>
    I, <%= suretyName %>, do hereby declare myself surety for the above named <%= suretyForPerson %> of <%= suretyAddress %> that he shall attend before <%= suretyCourt %> in the court of <%= suretyAnswerCourt %> on the <%= suretyAnswerDay %> day of <%= suretyAnswerMonth %>, <%= suretyAnswerYear %>, to answer to the charge on which he has been arrested, and shall continue to attend until otherwise directed by the court and in case of his making default therein, I bind myself to forfeit, to Government the sum of Rs. <%= suretyForfeitAmount %>.
  </p>

  <p>
    Dated this <%= suretyDateDay %> day of <%= suretyDateMonth %>, <%= suretyDateYear %>
  </p>

  <p>
    (Signature): <%= suretySignature %>
  </p>

</body>
</html>